# portfolio.me

This repo is the portfolio.me pipeline: turn a person into a deployed portfolio
site. To run it, read AGENTS.md and PRINCIPLES.md, then work loops/00-bootstrap.md
through loops/07-verify.md in order, stopping at Gates A, B1, B2, and C for the
human. Five rules are hard and never skip: every claim traces to evidence,
accessibility basics, reversible deploys, Gate C, and identity safety. Interview
first (it is the only source of the story), generate every visual, self-host every
asset, and verify the live site by screenshot.
